# FitTrack SDD Rules

Read `docs/CONSTITUTION.md` and `spec/manifest.json` before non-trivial work.

## Change order (mandatory)

1. Update `spec/*.json` (+ docs if user-visible)
2. Update `tests/` fixtures or assertions
3. Implement in `src/domain/` or `src/components/`
4. Run `npm run verify` — must pass

## Source of truth

- Constants: `spec/exercise-aliases.json`, `spec/exercise-catalog.json`, `spec/app-config.json`
- Formulas: `spec/formula-fixtures.json` → `src/domain/metrics.js`
- Parser: `spec/parser-fixtures.json` → `parseWorkoutText()` in `shared.jsx`
- Schema: `spec/data-model.schema.json`

Never duplicate spec data inline in source files.

## Before finishing

Run `npm run verify`. Update `spec/file-tree.json` and `docs/source-index.md` when adding/removing files.
